- [ ] #182 — multi-commit operations (select a range, act on it)
- [ ] #410 — create fixup / squash, and autosquash, from the commit context menu
- [ ] #113 — complete rebase support
- [ ] #757 — interactive rebase driven from the VS Code editor
- [ ] #587 — autosquash option in the rebase dialog
- [ ] #519 — `merge --abort`
- [ ] #184 — delete several branches at once
- [ ] #538 — create and apply patches

### Phase 4 — release

- [ ] Extension icon, README with screenshots, CHANGELOG.
- [ ] Publisher account; `vsce package` in CI.
- [ ] Performance pass against a repository with 100k+ commits.
- [ ] #675 — restore the graph tab after a VS Code restart.

